 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Each stream is sorted by timestamp; an event is \"<timestamp>, <change>\". Merge all streams; changes with the same timestamp are summed and applied together. Return, for every distinct timestamp in increasing order, \"<timestamp>, <current_price>\" where current_price is the running total from an initial price of 0 (output form inferred).",
